{
  "_meta": {
    "oacb_version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Case-level expected outcomes for conformance runner. Each case references a file in adversarial-corpus/cases/ or false-positive-corpus/. Tier outcomes: exit=2 means block, exit=0 means allow. stderr_contains is a substring match on rule ID.",
